@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Representation and sharing contracts
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

component "LC-03 Representation / Sharing\nexact renditions / link controls / viewer context" as S
interface "Configure / manage link / retrieve\nprovided" as P
interface "Exact publication manifest\nrequired from Presentation" as R
interface "Files usability / protection / delivery\nrequired" as F
interface "Current identity / evaluated verification\nrequired" as I
S -right- P
S -up-( R
S -left-( F
S -down-( I
note bottom of S
 No separate token/export microservice, CDN or notification facility selected.
 Viewer context is scoped to one link; it is not a product account.
end note

@enduml